### REGISTER FISH DUPLICATION
POST http://localhost:3001/catchFish/registerFish
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "participant": "6a97f5ed4b439f941761a0d3",
    "fiscal": "6a97f851a8aba5f959dff2d6",
    "species": "Dorado",
